摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A curated directory of source-verified DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugins, tools, design workflows, and official resources.","id":"gh:1333183810","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"awesome-deepseek-harness-plugins","slug":"walkinglabs/awesome-deepseek-harness-plugins","topics":["deepseek-harness","digital-persona","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","dshpersona","openclaw","skill-generator"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A curated directory of source-verified DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugins, tools, design workflows, and "},{"id":"p1s2","text":" of source-verified DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugins, tools, design workflows, and official resources."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Awesome DeepSeek Harness Plugins [](https://awesome.re)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> A curated index of plugins, starters, tools, and primary resources for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness is DeepSeek AI's open-source, plugin-first agent harness: models, tools, skills, se"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ssions, sandboxes, filesystems, loops, orchestration, and UI can all be composed as plugins."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Developer preview** — DSH is changing quickly and may introduce breaking changes. This independe"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"nt community list is not endorsed by DeepSeek AI or walkinglabs. Review source code and pin a DSH ve"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"rsion/commit before installing any third-party plugin. 中文说明"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick Tutorial — Install DSH and Write Your First Plugin"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 1. Install and run DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install a current Node.js release, then run:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Open `http://127.0.0.1:3080`. In **Settings → Models**, add a DeepSeek API key; then select a worksp"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ace before starting a session. The official Web UI guide explains the next steps."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 2. Create a minimal plugin from source"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Plugin development currently starts from an official DSH checkout:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Create `scratch-plugin/src/hello-plugin.ts`:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Then create `scratch-plugin/cordis.yml`. Replace the path with the absolute path printed by `pwd` in"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ch-plugin/cordis.yml`. Replace the path with the absolute path printed by `pwd` in the DSH checkout:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Run the development overlay:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"When DSH starts, the terminal should show `[hello-plugin] loaded`. This is the smallest valid DSH pl"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ugin: export `apply(ctx)` and register capabilities through the Cordis context. To add an agent-call"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"able tool, declare `export const inject = ['tools']` and register it with the documented DSH tool AP"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"I. Follow the official first plugin and tool-plugin tutorials for the complete, current API."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 3. How the plugin mechanism works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"DSH is built on **Cordis**, a runtime composition framework. A plugin is not merely an npm dependenc"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"y: it is a module that DSH loads into a live context. The plugin declares a `name`, optionally decla"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"res `inject` dependencies such as `['tools']`, and exports `apply(ctx, config)`. Cordis waits until "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"injected services are ready, validates any exported `Config` schema and defaults, then invokes `appl"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ected services are ready, validates any exported `Config` schema and defaults, then invokes `apply`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Inside `apply`, the plugin can register a tool for the agent, a human command, a settings schema, ev"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ent listeners, Web UI components, or a service for other plugins. Registrations are lifecycle-manage"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"d effects: on unload or hot replacement after a config edit, Cordis removes old registrations automa"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"tically. Use `ctx.effect()` only when your plugin owns a resource needing explicit cleanup, such as "},{"id":"p26s5","text":"a timer or network connection. See the official configuration guide, service guide, and capability s"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"er or network connection. See the official configuration guide, service guide, and capability seams."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 4. What this awesome list includes"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The list distinguishes verified DSH plugins from useful but non-plugin resources such as launchers, "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"clients, and ecosystem directories. See the full inclusion policy for the evidence required before a"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" new entry is added."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### 5. One runtime, different compositions"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"DSH profiles are plugin compositions rather than separately maintained products. The official base b"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"undle includes model adapters, tools, persistence, sandbox and approval policy, settings, credential"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"s, and telemetry; Web and headless bundles add different entry surfaces. An agent preset can then gi"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ve a session a different capability set."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"This makes a “mode” primarily a selected plugin graph and policy set. It does not guarantee that eve"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ry composition is stable or suitable for every task; DSH is still a developer preview."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### 6. Tool calls use one guarded execution pipeline"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Plugins can insert policy, observability, timeout, or result-handling behavior at documented stages "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"without editing the Agent Loop. The official pipeline also routes Code Mode's dispatched sub-calls t"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"hrough this same path, preserving the approval, sandbox, and logging boundaries."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### 7. Agent turns, steps, and the append-only session log"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The session log is the model-context source of truth: durable events record turns, messages, tool ca"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"lls/results, and raw stream chunks. Forking, resuming, replay, transcripts, telemetry, and persisten"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ce derive from that stream; model-visible content must be reconstructable from it."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### 8. Multi-agent and workflow extension points"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"DSH provides a hierarchy-oriented delegation surface and workflow components; providers behind the s"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"ubagent seam can vary. The key architectural point is replaceability and shared observability, not a"},{"id":"p42s3","text":" claim that DSH has invented a new multi-agent paradigm."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"- Start Here — Official DSH Resources\n- Install and Discover Plugins\n- Productivity & Agent Workflow"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"\n- Context, Memory & Observability\n- Tools, Integrations & Automation\n- Design & Creative Tools\n- Br"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"owser, Computer Use & Remote Execution\n- Interfaces & Web UI\n- Developer Tooling\n- Utilities\n- Creat"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"ive & Personal\n- Games & Play\n- Launchers & Clients\n- Ecosystem Indexes\n- Contributing\n- License"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Start Here — Official DSH Resources"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness - Official source repository; the primary reference for releases, issues, and com"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"patibility.\n- Documentation guide - Official documentation portal supplied by the DSH project.\n- Run"},{"id":"p46s3","text":" DSH - Start the local Web UI with `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh web`.\n- Architecture - How the plugin-first"},{"id":"p46s4","text":" DSH runtime is structured.\n- Capability seams - Extension boundaries for DSH capabilities.\n- Cordis"},{"id":"p46s5","text":" primer - Introduction to the underlying composability framework.\n- Development guide - Build DSH fr"},{"id":"p46s6","text":"om source and contribute upstream.\n- Defensive patterns - Official guidance for safer extensions.\n- "},{"id":"p46s7","text":"Testing - DSH testing approaches.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
